geance!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/l7LjNBXDVCHPvTvmPG3d4xvlPKK.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"5873","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"4214","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"4214","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"36983","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81184","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"16235","synopsis":"While it is meant to enhance the relationships within a nuclear family so that the youthful student excels academically to prosperity, this Parents' Day at Youkai Academy becomes another day for both Mizore's mother Tsurara and Kurumu's mother Ageha to prosecute their long-standing rivalry that has proven to be a stalemate on all counts. Under the mirage of Tsukune as her daughter's boyfriend, both Tsurara and Ageha endeavor to coerce matrimonial copulation of Tsukune with their respective offspring. Hopefully Tsukune will survive the barrage of love...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ow3oxhceiXWsJxVeg3NiTIMJIVg.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"While it is meant to enhance the relationships within a nuclear family so that the youthful student excels academically to prosperity, this Parents' Day at Youkai Academy becomes another day for both Mizore's mother Tsurara and Kurumu's mother Ageha to prosecute their long-standing rivalry that has proven to be a stalemate on all counts. Under the mirage of Tsukune as her daughter's boyfriend, both Tsurara and Ageha endeavor to coerce matrimonial copulation of Tsukune with their respective offspring. Hopefully Tsukune will survive the barrage of love...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ow3oxhceiXWsJxVeg3NiTIMJIVg.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"5873","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"4214","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"4214","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"36983","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81184","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"16226","synopsis":"Yukari is bothered by the fact that she is still a child and with the help of someone, she has been given the chance to experience life as a grown up. Of all the possibilities of her new live, getting Tsukune's love is one of the top priorities. But while all the other boys - and girls - of the high school seem to react to her new appearance, the target of all her trouble seems to be ignorant to it. Will Yukari be able to change the tide?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jiHuKSed2koj2MhJvQ5l1f4ehQw.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"Yukari is bothered by the fact that she is still a child and with the help of someone, she has been given the chance to experience life as a grown up. Of all the possibilities of her new live, getting Tsukune's love is one of the top priorities. But while all the other boys - and girls - of the high school seem to react to her new appearance, the target of all her trouble seems to be ignorant to it. Will Yukari be able to change the tide?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jiHuKSed2koj2MhJvQ5l1f4ehQw.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"5873","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"4214","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"4214","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"36983","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81184","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"16233","synopsis":"Moka, Kurumu, Yukari and Mizore want to win Tsukune's affection by practicing on making a perfect curry dish. While Mizore is trying to improve her cooking by herself, Moka, Kurumu and Yukari are attending a cooking class with a very passionate teacher when it comes to Indian curry. But will all the cooking at Youkai Academy find a way to Tsukune's stomach and heart or will all attempts be in vain?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jEERjoDotXsORNUuOBvvrJBwP66.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"Moka, Kurumu, Yukari and Mizore want to win Tsukune's affection by practicing on making a perfect curry dish. While Mizore is trying to improve her cooking by herself, Moka, Kurumu and Yukari are attending a cooking class with a very passionate teacher when it comes to Indian curry. But will all the cooking at Youkai Academy find a way to Tsukune's stomach and heart or will all attempts be in vain?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jEERjoDotXsORNUuOBvvrJBwP66.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"5873","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"4214","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"4214","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"36983","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81184","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"16232","synopsis":"The group goes on a field trip to the human world. While there Moka wants to spend more time with Tsukune, but Kurumu, Mizore and Yukari make it impossible as they try to get close to him themselves. Will Moka chan finally be able to get her private time with Tsukune or will she have to share once more?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5enW9o10Eey873x9bYkStZSm2Sm.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"The group goes on a field trip to the human world. While there Moka wants to spend more time with Tsukune, but Kurumu, Mizore and Yukari make it impossible as they try to get close to him themselves. Will Moka chan finally be able to get her private time with Tsukune or will she have to share once more?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5enW9o10Eey873x9bYkStZSm2Sm.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"5873","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"4214","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"4214","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"36983","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81184","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"16234","synopsis":"Tsukune's decision to use a portion of his time on the field trip to pay his mother Kasumi a visit at home that is meant to be a quiet heartfelt family event, begins its metamorphsis into a circus when Moka follows Tsukune home, much to Kasumi's shock. But before long, the madness that usually fills Youkai Academy finds it way to Tsukune's home.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/myq6efYt5pJKS0Ns39QfZpxUhEc.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"Tsukune's decision to use a portion of his time on the field trip to pay his mother Kasumi a visit at home that is meant to be a quiet heartfelt family event, begins its metamorphsis into a circus when Moka follows Tsukune home, much to Kasumi's shock. But before long, the madness that usually fills Youkai Academy finds it way to Tsukune's home.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/myq6efYt5pJKS0Ns39QfZpxUhEc.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsi